ternet connection e.g. find out when the last bus is scheduled to leave. \n* View official MTA route maps for the Subway and the bus networks in Manhattan, Brooklyn, Queens, the Bronx & Staten Island. \n* Find out latest news that might affect your daily commute, as well as status updates for bus, subway, rail, bridges & tunnels. \n* Add stops to your favorites so you can quickly find out when your next buses are due to arrive. \n* View bus routes on the map and find out where they go. \n* Search for a location or pin point your current position on the map so you can find nearby bus stops. \n* Use the official MTA Journey planner to find out how to get from A to B. \n* Lots of information about the MTA, including fares and MetroCards, FAQs, accessibility, contact details, how to get to and from the airports and lots more. \n* Find out the latest news about your transport network, including improvements and innovations. \n* Plus: many of the features work offline! Use it whilst on the Subway, or when you have no signal. \n\nBe green! Let's try and get more people using public transport in New York City! \n\nWe love to receive feedback :) Email us at busNYC@electriclabs.com for comments or suggestions you have about the app. \n\nThis app was produced by Electric Labs Ltd under licence from the Metropolitan Transportation Authority (MTA). \n\nFor a full list of supported bus routes, please visit:\nhttp://www.electriclabs.com/bus-new-york-city/route-list", "sellerUrl": "http://www.electriclabs.com/#/busNYC", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "102672384", "formattedPrice": "￦4,400", "trackContentRating": "4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackId": 424433686, "trackName": "Bus New York City", "userRatingCount": 0}]}